	)
	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: 100 nF caps at each VCC/VDD pin. TPS3430 pad to GND with vias.\nKeep WDT_CRST short (high-impedance node). R_OUT near J5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 220.98 0)
		(size 76.2 38.1)
		(margins 2.25 2.25 2.25 2.25)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 0 255 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "307d880e-359f-4587-a0fb-bf569390a203")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE: BMS_OK LOGIC\nBMS_OK = NFAULT AND MCU_BMS_OK AND WDT_OK. Any input low -> no opto current -> BMS relay opens.\n- NFAULT: BQ79600 open-drain fault, 100k pull-up on Com. Chip page (SLUSDS1A p.3).\n- MCU_BMS_OK: high only after a fresh valid stack read; 10k pull-down holds it low in reset.\n- WDT_OK: TPS3430 window watchdog, CWD=10k, SET0=0, SET1=1 -> window 10.35-165.8 ms\n  worst case (SBVS366A p.18). Kick on falling edge every 100 ms.\n- U4/U5 outputs go high-Z when unpowered (Ioff), so loss of 3V3 = BMS_OK off.\n- R_OUT 330R: ~6 mA nominal, ~3 mA worst case into the opto.\n- Readbacks/LEDs are behind 10k so a diagnostic fault can't force a safety net high."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 180.34 0)
		(size 76.2 35.56)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 200 200 200 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "335d354c-f79e-4033-9f53-0901be0735b6")
	)
	(text_box "CAUTION: WATCHDOG LATCH\nU5 holds CRST low once WDO trips, so WDO stays low until 3V3 drops below 1.6 V\n(TPS3430 Design 3, SBVS366A p.23-24). A watchdog trip needs a GLV power cycle AND the\nshutdown-board BMS reset. CRST 4.7 nF -> ~15.5 ms startup grace; firmware must start\nkicking before tRST + tWDU(min)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 114.3 220.98 0)
		(size 106.68 40.64)
		(margins 2 2 2 2)
		(stroke
			(width 1)
			(type solid)
			(color 250 236 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "Arial")
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "947ec6ee-8389-464d-a636-4e6773409b5b")
	)
